They gave me the longest engagement that you see me win in earlier years.
他们给了我“最长订婚奖”，你们在早些年里能看到我获奖。

1371
00:54:44.130 --> 00:54:45.710
I have the tight ass award.
我有“翘臀奖”。

1372
00:54:45.910 --> 00:54:50.150
And then from years later, which we'll get to, I have the she's kind of a bitch.
还有几年后，我们之后会讲到，我拿到了“她有点刻薄奖”。

1373
00:54:50.630 --> 00:54:54.330
I think Pam doesn't get a Dundee the second time around.
我觉得帕姆第二次没拿到邓迪奖。

1374
00:54:54.690 --> 00:54:55.690
I don't think so.
我觉得也是。

1375
00:54:55.910 --> 00:54:57.030
There weren't as many that round.
那次没发那么多奖。

1376
00:54:57.310 --> 00:54:59.010
I have a final fan question.
我还有一个最后的粉丝提问。

1377
00:54:59.350 --> 00:55:01.170
This is something for us to discuss, Angela.
安吉拉，这事儿我们要讨论一下。

1378
00:55:01.330 --> 00:55:02.210
This is from Samantha.
这是萨曼莎问的。

1379
00:55:02.530 --> 00:55:02.810
Okay.
好的。

1380
