What?
什么？

1383
00:55:13.210 --> 00:55:16.650
Within 10 minutes of the line, I feel God in this Chili's tonight.
就在我说出“今晚我在这个辣椒餐厅感受到了上帝”这句台词的10分钟内。

1384
00:55:16.810 --> 00:55:18.730
Samantha, first of all, where do you live?
萨曼莎，首先，你住哪儿？

1385
00:55:18.930 --> 00:55:21.590
Do you think I'm jinxed or is it just bad luck?
你觉得我是被诅咒了还是单纯运气不好？

1386
00:55:22.030 --> 00:55:24.370
Should Samantha ever watch this episode again?
萨曼莎还应该再看这一集吗？

1387
00:55:24.370 --> 00:55:26.950
I would say, do you live in Tornado Alley?
我想问，你住在龙卷风走廊吗？

1388
